    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;13.02</strong> Comparison of usual gastrointestinal stromal tumours (GISTs) and succinate dehydrogenase (SDH)-deficient GISTs <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{20305538;21997692;21753704;29239034}</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
